1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,190
Pongal. Every fan was ready to celebrate.

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:06,110
But Vijay's last film was stuck.

3
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:11,460
It was due on January 9, but a dispute with the censor board postponed it.

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:15,190
This wasn't just any film. It was his farewell.

5
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:19,730
On December 27, 2025, he announced his retirement after a 33-year career.

6
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:22,920
Fans had waited years for this day.

7
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:28,000
So what does a superstar do when the festival comes and his film doesn't?

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,270
He didn't stop. His party, TVK, had taken shape in 2024.

9
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,540
He fought the 2026 election and became Tamil Nadu's Chief Minister.

10
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,190
The film stayed on hold.

11
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:42,650
Then in July, Jana Nayagan finally hit theatres.

12
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:47,730
Fans danced and sang outside cinema halls, happy it had finally reached the screen,

13
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:50,920
yet emotional because it was his farewell.

14
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:55,460
The Pongal he missed became the biggest film festival of his life.

15
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:58,860
Follow for more real stories.

